gb(51, 51, 51);\">: 2022. 2. 3.(목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">) 09:00 ~ 2022. 3. 16.(수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">시까지</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"> ※ 서류제출 및 가구원 동의 : 2022. 2. 3.(목) 09:00 ~ 2022. 3. 18.(금) 18:00</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; ※ 주말 및 공휴일 포함 신청기간 내 24시간 신청가능(단, 마지막날은 18시 마감)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">신청대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: 2022-1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">학기 국가근로장학금 참여 희망 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">신청장소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">한국장학재단 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(www.kosaf.go.kr) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">및 모바일 어플 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">신청방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">첨부파일 매뉴얼 참조(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">문의:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">한국장학재단 ☎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">1599-2290)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">5.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">유의사항</span></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">희망근로기관 신청 및 선발 일정은 향후 학교 홈페이지 공고 예정   </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">- <b>2022-1</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">학기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">1</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><b>차 학생신청기간</b>에 국가근로장학금을 신청한 경우 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><b>1</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><b>학기 학기 중 및 방학 중 근로에 참여 가능</b>하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">- <b>2022-1</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">학기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">2</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><b>차 학생신청기간</b>에 신청할 경우 <b>1학기 방학 중 근로(교외집중근로)에 참여 가능</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">소득분위 확인자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">)</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt;\">신청기간에 국가근로장학금에 참여 신청을 하지 않을 경우 국가근로 참여 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 학자금 지원구간이 산정된 이후 근로 가능하므로 가급적 빠른 신청바람(장학금 신청일에 따라 학자금 지원구간 산정일정이 달라질 수 있음)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt;\">사정 및 일정에 따라 변경 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">붙임&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">학기 2차 국가근로신청 학생매뉴얼(모바일, 홈페이지)&nbsp;각&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">.</span><br></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"14224\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"user\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2022-01-28T19:46:14.308Z\",\n\"md\": \"2022-01-28T19:46:14.345Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\": false,\n\"tq\": false,\n\"da\": false,\n\"dw\": false,\n\"dj\": false,\n\"bc\": false,\n\"bu\": false,\n\"al\": false,\n\"ab\": false,\n\"ap\": false,\n\"an\": false,\n\"aa\": false,\n\"ds\": false,\n\"de\": false,\n\"as\": false,\n\"cp\": false,\n\"ao\": false,\n\"et\": false,\n\"ay\": false,\n\"am\": false,\n\"a1\": false,\n\"bt\": false,\n\"av\": false,\n\"dh\": false,\n\"dp\": false,\n\"d1\": false,\n\"mf\": false,\n\"bl\": false,\n\"ag\": false,\n\"dg\": false,\n\"ae\": false,\n\"df\": false,\n\"do\": false,\n\"dl\": false,\n\"di\": false,\n\"d2\": false,\n\"d3\": false,\n\"ob\": false,\n\"d4\": false,\n\"ev\": false,\n\"d5\": false,\n\"d6\": false,\n\"a2\": false,\n\"dc\": false\n}\n},\n\"ld\": {\n\"pa\": \"\",\n\"pi\": true,\n\"fo\": false\n}\n},\n\"b